paragraph_id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:p022","quote":"潁陰侯灌嬰者，睢陽販繒者也。高祖之為沛公，略地至雍丘下，章邯敗殺項梁，而沛公還軍於碭，嬰初以中涓從擊破東郡尉於成武及秦軍於扛裏，疾鬬，賜爵七大夫。從攻秦軍亳南、開封、曲遇，戰疾力，賜爵執帛，號宣陵君。從攻陽武以西至雒陽，破秦軍尸北，北絕河津，南破南陽守齮陽城東，遂定南陽郡。西入武關，戰於藍田，疾力，至霸上，賜爵執珪，號昌文君。"}],"rationale":"按本篇分傳、明示姓名與敘事承接限定異稱。酈寄字況據第14段；夏侯嬰的嬰限定第16至21段，灌嬰限定第22至33段，桓嬰另人。第6與20、28段楚王信和反韓王信分人；未詳名王侯不補名。同名跨篇同指另待逐項證據。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:p022","text":"潁陰侯灌嬰者，睢陽販繒者也。高祖之為沛公，略地至雍丘下，章邯敗殺項梁，而沛公還軍於碭，嬰初以中涓從擊破東郡尉於成武及秦軍於扛裏，疾鬬，賜爵七大夫。從攻秦軍亳南、開封、曲遇，戰疾力，賜爵執帛，號宣陵君。從攻陽武以西至雒陽，破秦軍尸北，北絕河津，南破南陽守齮陽城東，遂定南陽郡。西入武關，戰於藍田，疾力，至霸上，賜爵執珪，號昌文君。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m022-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"灌嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"mdl_l60_pwy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m022-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"vok_rjp_tag","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m022-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"vok_rjp_tag","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m022-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"ekn_61g_qaz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m022-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"d9l_4lw_kc2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m022-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"vok_rjp_tag","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m022-0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"mdl_l60_pwy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m022-0126","start":126,"end":127,"surface":"齮","kind":"person","person_id":"3vk_jr4_vnd","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang","book_id":"b-shiji-095","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-095-fankuang"